  },
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> flows through a wire of cross-sectional area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. The number of free electrons in a cubic meter are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>28</mn></msup></math>. The drift velocity of the electrons is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(given, charge on electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>).</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The drift velocity is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>28</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the given values in equation (i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>28</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.6</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>28</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.6</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.6</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
